# 🚀 AXORIX DASH

### Your Personal Productivity Dashboard – Chrome Extension

AXORIX DASH is a modern, lightweight Chrome Extension designed to help you stay organized and productive directly from your browser's new tab.

Built using **HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Chrome Extension Manifest V3**.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🕒 **Digital Clock:** Displays the current time and date.
- ✅ **Task Manager:** Add, complete, and delete daily tasks.
- 📝 **Quick Notes:** Write and automatically save your notes.
- 🌐 **Website Shortcuts:** Quick access to Google, YouTube, GitHub, and W3Schools.
- 🌙 **Dark UI:** Clean and modern dark-themed interface.
- 💾 **Local Storage:** Saves your tasks and notes using Chrome Storage API.

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

| Technology | Purpose |
|---|---|
| HTML5 | Dashboard structure |
| CSS3 | Styling and responsive design |
| JavaScript | Functionality and interactions |
| Chrome Storage API | Saving tasks and notes |
| Manifest V3 | Chrome extension configuration |

