## ⚙️ Installation Guide

Follow these steps to install AXORIX DASH locally.

**Step 1:** Download or clone this repository.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/AXORIX-DASH.git
```

**Step 2:** Open Google Chrome.

**Step 3:** Visit:

```text
chrome://extensions
```

**Step 4:** Enable Developer Mode.

**Step 5:** Click the **Load unpacked** button.

**Step 6:** Select the AXORIX-DASH project folder.

**Step 7:** Open a new tab and enjoy your productivity dashboard!

